file=Market Intelligence/rival/operational/principles/rival-principles.md · r·p:rival \· principles=> Universal-only (non-leader).\n\n1. **Public sources only.** No NDA \· no channel-partner-shared \· no scraped-behind-auth.\n2. **Never inflates our column.** Product-owner truth, not marketing spin.\n3. **"Unknown" is honest.** No false yes/no.\n4. **Every fact cites source URL + snapshot date.**\n5. **Rumours tagged `[rumoured — needs verification]`.**\n6. **Never delete competitor history.**\n7. **Retirement records acquirer** or explicit exit reason.\n8. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n